{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"They forcefully remove their gaze from everything around them and back to Bo.","created_at":"2021-07-26T07:30:50.748000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869119560769470485","reply_to_id":"869119096611016714","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"I did favors for mal... And always turned down his payment then he offered to give me what i desire. At the time I didnt desire anything. I had came to this city to make new friends, told him that i was even happy with my goal. He said he owed me then.\" He pauses. \"But then, in ferrytown, a friend fell. They died. I called out to mal and told him that I desired the power to stop my friends from death.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T07:31:49.868000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869119808736739328","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"He sits in a chair. \"Mal brought me hear, and tought me how to use medicine. How to save a life with tools. Last night, he brought me here again. I met with, something. We did a ritual, and inwas cast into a place that i still cannot comprehend.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T07:33:05.957000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869120127877124138","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"Bo clears his throat and smiles. \"I made a pact with this masive dragon... The cost? A promise to always try to make friends. In return, I gained power.... Celestial power.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T07:34:07.449000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869120385793265695","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"I have gained the power to revive people to heal. I'll do whatever I can to save another life, to take away the cost of bringing people back!\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T07:35:29.386000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869120729461981214","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"Bo smiles \"people think he's strange, but there is goodness in his heart. He's honest, and he pays the debts he owes. I'd stand behind him, even if it meant my life.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T07:36:37.810000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869121016453025812","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"If he promises something... He'll pay.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T07:42:39.760000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869122534581350460","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"Jigsaw stands and listens to all of this, and for the first time they seem to really, genuinely listen and give their full attention to someone. They sigh and sit criss cross on the ground near Bo's chair. \"It's good to hear all of this. I.... I appreciate it.\" They pause for a long time. \"I've heard you sing in goblin, so you must know a bit about how our tribes usually work. Believe it or not, they have an organized power structure. A clear leader. Roles and tasks for everyone. Our tribe was... Different. It was run by whoever could cause the most chaos, which we were especially well known for.\" They pause, \"I was able to thrive in this environment... Where I could do what I wanted and be rewarded for causing destruction. But it was at a cost. Everyone was always looking to out smart the person ahead of them. There was always some trick or strings attached. It grew tiring. So I left for the city... Only to find the same was true here.\" They rub their hand across their eyes, \"point is, trust doesn't come easy to me. And old habits die hard. I keep myself to simple goals like building my armor and fighting coats because if I don't, I feel like the whole word is out to get me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T07:48:05.597000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869123901240774678","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"Bo smiles. \"Down with the coats! Of that you have at least my assurance!\" He shrugs. \"I dont know who the enemy of Malathor, or even if he has a true enemy... But me? I despise the coats completely.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T07:50:36.791000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869124535394373683","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"They grin widely and snicker, which slowly turns into all out laughter \"DOWN WITH THE DIRTY COATS!!\" they let out a wild holler","created_at":"2021-07-26T07:52:48.801000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869125089084457021","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
